      "lines": [
        "The author’s first",
        "food garden, 1991."
      ],
      "x": 103,
      "top": 216,
      "width": 74,
      "size": 8.25,
      "leading": 10.5
    }
  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "paragraph": 0,
      "text": "I built my first food garden over 30 years ago. As",
      "x": 17,
      "right": 100.23094298183264,
      "baseline": 43,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 10.5,
      "width": 80.9101125
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 0,
      "text": "a child I had been fascinated by the way seeds",
      "x": 17,
      "right": 101.16346786539654,
      "baseline": 48.11527777777778,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 10.5,
      "width": 76.97258333333333
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 0,
      "text": "became plants, the plants became vegetables, and",
      "x": 17,
      "right": 102.55618545997947,
      "baseline": 53.230555555555554,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 10.5,
      "width": 83.988275
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 0,
      "text": "the vegetables made a meal. As a young adult",
      "x": 17,
      "right": 104.59536014907223,
      "baseline": 58.34583333333333,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 10.5,
      "width": 76.90220416666666
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 0,
      "text": "gardener, I wanted to participate in this process. I felt",
      "x": 17,
      "right": 107.32039454397751,
      "baseline": 63.46111111111111,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 10.5,
      "width": 88.07397083333332
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 0,
      "text": "that gardening could give me two things that I couldn't",
      "x": 17,
      "right": 110.79072374581007,
      "baseline": 68.57638888888889,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 10.5,
      "width": 90.93729166666667
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 0,
      "text": "get in any other way: free or almost free food, and a way of",
      "x": 17,
      "right": 115.09639829716627,
      "baseline": 73.69166666666666,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 10.5,
      "width": 97.90853333333332
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 0,
      "text": "saying ‘No’ to artificial chemicals in my diet.",
      "x": 17,
      "right": 120.37961009242815,
      "baseline": 78.80694444444444,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 10.5,
      "width": 72.009
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "text": "It was natural to me from the beginning to grow organically. When I",
      "x": 17,
      "right": 131.13930996337112,
      "baseline": 86.74444444444444,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 10.5,
      "width": 112.85114166666666
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "text": "first began, organic gardening was on the fringes and I",
      "x": 17,
      "right": 117,
      "baseline": 91.85972222222222,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 10.5,
      "width": 90.31869583333332
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "text": "struggled to find the information I needed. Now organic",
      "x": 17,
      "right": 117,
      "baseline": 96.975,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 10.5,
      "width": 92.02631666666666
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "text": "gardening is mainstream. Nowadays a book of organic",
      "x": 17,
      "right": 117,
      "baseline": 102.09027777777777,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 10.5,
      "width": 89.85567499999999
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "text": "gardening techniques, as this one is, no longer has to be",
      "x": 17,
      "right": 117,
      "baseline": 107.20555555555555,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 10.5,
      "width": 92.86345833333333
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "text": "labelled or put in a special section; organic is mainstream",
      "x": 17,
      "right": 177,
      "baseline": 112.32083333333333,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 10.5,
      "width": 94.54885416666666
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "text": "gardening now, and the world is a better place for it.",
      "x": 17,
      "right": 177,
      "baseline": 117.4361111111111,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 10.5,
      "width": 86.97383333333333
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "text": "Books enter and leave a gardener's life on a regular basis. Techniques and varieties change and",
      "x": 17,
      "right": 177,
      "baseline": 125.3736111111111,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 10.5,
      "width": 157.89010416666665
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "text": "need updating, and the books themselves (at least, the good ones!) end up being dropped onto",
      "x": 17,
      "right": 177,
      "baseline": 130.48888888888888,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 10.5,
      "width": 157.07148333333333
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "text": "the soil or left out in the rain and having to be replaced. Nothing will make me happier one day",
      "x": 17,
      "right": 177,
      "baseline": 135.60416666666666,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 10.5,
      "width": 156.58994166666665
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "text": "than to discover second-hand, battered copies of The Vegetable Guru with soil stains and notes",
      "x": 17,
      "right": 177,
      "baseline": 140.71944444444443,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 10.5,
      "width": 158.47165833333332
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "text": "in the margin: a book used the way I intended it, as an",
      "x": 17,
      "right": 177,
      "baseline": 145.8347222222222,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 10.5,
      "width": 89.01853333333332
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "text": "everyday guide rather than a coffee-table ornament.",
      "x": 17,
      "right": 177,
      "baseline": 150.95,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 10.5,
      "width": 86.55155833333333
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "text": "The Vegetable Guru is a reference to be used. It is about facts, solid growing facts. You will find",
      "x": 17,
      "right": 177,
      "baseline": 158.8875,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 10.5,
      "width": 158.01604583333332
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "text": "no artistic photographs or long backstories here; just solid growing information and the",
      "x": 17,
      "right": 177,
      "baseline": 164.00277777777777,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 10.5,
      "width": 144.09208333333333
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "text": "illustrations to support it, logically arranged on facing pages, with the vegetable",
      "x": 40.3714848439029,
      "right": 177,
      "baseline": 169.11805555555554,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 10.5,
      "width": 132.5832375
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "text": "guides arranged alphabetically, and the pests section by plant group.",
      "x": 58.2681626518878,
      "right": 177,
      "baseline": 174.23333333333332,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 10.5,
      "width": 114.45875000000001
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 4,
      "text": "I hope you enjoy using The Vegetable Guru as much as I",
      "x": 73.63005553454997,
      "right": 177,
      "baseline": 182.17083333333332,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 10.5,
      "width": 92.79307916666666
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 4,
      "text": "enjoyed writing it. I wish you the best of success with your",
      "x": 80.20895878638153,
      "right": 177,
      "baseline": 187.2861111111111,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 10.5,
      "width": 96.5342875
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 4,
      "text": "gardening, both now and in the future.",
      "x": 85.17107139940678,
      "right": 177,
      "baseline": 192.40138888888887,
      "font": "Body",
      "size": 10.5,
      "width": 63.67092083333333
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 5,
      "text": "John Lennon — Cornwall, England,",
      "x": 92.286249964944,
      "right": 177,
      "baseline": 200.33888888888887,
      "font": "Bold",
      "size": 10.5,
      "width": 60.07787916666667
    },
    {
      "paragraph": 5,
      "text": "November 2026.",
      "x": 92.286249964944,
      "right": 177,
      "baseline": 205.45416666666665,
      "font": "Bold",
      "size": 10.5,
      "width": 28.603575
    }
  ],
